Hi {Owner},

I build websites for driving schools around {City}. {Business Name} has proud new drivers on its social pages, but no site where a parent can see class dates and enrol a teen online.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: the teen licence steps in order, behind the wheel pickup zones, a road test day package, defensive driving courses, the insurance discount certificate and online enrolment, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and class date updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone between lessons?

{Your Name}
